# app/globals.css carries the shadcn preset's identity. `pnpm format` only targets
# **/*.{ts,tsx} so it never reaches this file, but a `prettier --write` naming it
# explicitly reindents all ~120 preset token lines from 4 spaces to 2 — which is the
# "reformatting the existing token values" the design-system steering rules out, and it
# buries an additive change in a whole-file diff no reviewer can read.
#
# Additive edits (appending a new token block) are expected. Reformatting is not.
app/globals.css
